WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.626 --> 00:00:03.337
I have to get to the truth
of what happened that night.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:10.802
I am for truth, no matter who tells it.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:16.183
I'm for justice,
no matter who it's for or against.

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:25.901
Eighteen years, ten months, 24 days.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:28.570
That's how long Warren Cave
has sat in prison

00:00:28.654 --> 00:00:30.280
for the murder of Chuck Buhrman.

00:00:30.364 --> 00:00:33.408
I helped seal Warren's fate
with a series of articles.

00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:38.956
But is there an innocent man in prison...

00:00:39.957 --> 00:00:43.293
and did I lead that charge?

00:00:57.307 --> 00:01:01.144
You portrayed me
as a privileged psychopath.

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:06.441
Now I live in a house

00:01:06.525 --> 00:01:09.987
full of men who breathe to lie...

00:01:10.988 --> 00:01:14.366
and I could smell yours
before you even started talking.

00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:19.496
How could a mother and two daughters

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:21.957
sleep through such a violent encounter?

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:25.794
And they never recovered
the murder weapon.

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:28.505
-What are you hiding?
-You leave it.

00:01:28.839 --> 00:01:30.841
Or I can make your life miserable in here.

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:36.096
There's a monster inside every one of us.

00:01:36.513 --> 00:01:37.598
You terrify me.

00:01:38.891 --> 00:01:41.059
What about you? What's in there?

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:44.646
You're playing with people's lives.

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:46.023
Are you ready for the consequences?

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:49.026
You think all the secrets
came out during the trial?

00:01:50.027 --> 00:01:52.821
-You tell Parnell to back away.
-You messed with her family.

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:56.658
You have no idea
what I've done for my daughters.

00:01:57.201 --> 00:01:59.661
Families... they take care of each other.

00:02:07.503 --> 00:02:10.297
I have to get to the truth
of what happened that night.

00:02:12.674 --> 00:02:14.676
The people will get their show.

